    "description": "Immediately after a creature you can see within 30 feet hits you with an attack roll and damages you, you can use your Reaction to require it to make a Constitution saving throw. On failure it takes 1d8 plus Proficiency Bonus Cold damage and has Speed 0 until the end of its next turn; on success it suffers neither effect. Proficiency Bonus uses per Long Rest.",
